%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: Parcel for "V., Server Room". Nobody signs. Nobody admits there is a V. I have been down here two hours.
#
o_text: What's in it?
o_id: milo_parcel
o_goto: Parcel
#
o_text: Good luck.
o_id: milo_leave
o_goto: End

name: Parcel
npc: Heavy, hums a little, label says "CP-3 POWER" crossed out and "SPARE" written over it. I don't ask.
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: parcel_back
o_goto: Default

name: End
npc: (He checks the parcel address again.)
effect: EndConversation
